OL,3,GNEWSASchool on the hunt for missing
OL,4,Atime capsules
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff, students and alumni at a primary
OL,7,Fschool hope to locate missing time
OL,8,Fcapsules as part of 50th anniversary
OL,9,Fcelebrations.
OL,11,FLa Houguette School in Guernsey wanted
OL,12,Fto dig up the capsules and create a new
OL,13,Fone to mark the occasion, but simply
OL,14,F"can't find them".
OL,16,FThe school opened on 19 November 1976
OL,17,Fto serve St Pierre du Bois, St Saviour
OL,18,Fand Torteval.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
