OL,3,GNEWSASchool on the hunt for missing
OL,4,Atime capsules
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher Claire Judd said the
OL,7,Fgolden jubilee year was "such a
OL,8,Fmilestone" and "we really wanted to
OL,9,Fcelebrate it", but efforts to find the
OL,10,Ftime capsules for the special day had
OL,11,Fproved fruitless.
